 the multiples of 7 from 7 to 994, and cross out those divisible by 3 or 5, then check digit sum parity.\n\nLet's go step by step.\n\nMultiples of 7:\n1-10: 7\n11-20: 14\n21-30: 21, 28\n31-40: 35, 42\n41-50: 49, 56\n51-60: 63, 70\n61-70: 77\n71-80: 84, 91\n81-90: 98\n91-100: 105\n101-110: 112, 119\n111-120: 126, 133\n121-130: 140\n131-140: 147, 154\n141-150: 161, 168\n151-160: 175, 182\n161-170: 189, 196\n171-180: 203\n181-190: 210, 217\n191-200: 224, 231\n201-210: 238, 245\n211-220: 252","sequence_number":577,"content_index":0}

